---
---

<div class="verdict-panel glass-panel" id="verdict-container">
  <div class="verdict-header">
    <div class="header-badge-wrap">
      <span class="badge badge-agri" id="badge-semaforo">Auditoría Pendiente</span>
      <span class="badge badge-jev" id="badge-confianza">JEV Calibrado</span>
    </div>
    <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" id="btn-copy-report">
      📋 Copiar Informe
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="score-hero">
    <div class="score-circle-container">
      <svg class="score-svg" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
        <circle class="score-bg-circle" cx="50" cy="50" r="42"></circle>
        <circle class="score-fill-circle" id="score-meter" cx="50" cy="50" r="42"></circle>
      </svg>
      <div class="score-text-box">
        <span class="score-number" id="verdict-score">--</span>
        <span class="score-max">/100</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="score-summary">
      <h3 class="verdict-title" id="verdict-title">Selecciona un lote en Buenos Aires</h3>
      <p class="verdict-desc" id="verdict-desc">
        Haz click en el mapa satelital o elige uno de los partidos preconfigurados para iniciar el análisis multiagente con JEV y STAC.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Cultivos Sugeridos -->
  <div class="section-box">
    <h4 class="section-title">🌾 Especies y Cultivos Recomendados</h4>
    <div class="chips-container" id="crops-container">
      <span class="chip-item">Esperando análisis...</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Recomendaciones de Manejo Agronómico -->
  <div class="section-box">
    <h4 class="section-title">🚜 Recomendaciones y Sistematización</h4>
    <ul class="recommendations-list" id="recomms-list">
      <li>Selecciona un terreno para evaluar aptitud, obras de drenaje y manejo sustentable.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .verdict-panel {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: 20px;
    background: rgba(13, 19, 35, 0.82);
    min-height: 400px;
  }

  .verdict-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .header-badge-wrap {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .btn-sm {
    padding: 5px 12px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
  }

  .score-hero {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    background: rgba(10, 15, 29, 0.7);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 16px 20px;
  }

  .score-circle-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .score-svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    transform: rotate(-90deg);
  }

  .score-bg-circle {
    fill: none;
    stroke: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    stroke-width: 8;
  }

  .score-fill-circle {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--color-agri);
    stroke-width: 8;
    stroke-dasharray: 264;
    stroke-dashoffset: 264;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    transition: stroke-dashoffset 1s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), stroke 0.4s ease;
  }

  .score-text-box {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .score-number {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1;
    display: block;
  }

  .score-max {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .score-summary {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .verdict-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .verdict-desc {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .section-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .chips-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .chip-item {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.25);
    color: var(--color-agri-light);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .recommendations-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .recommendations-list li {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding-left: 18px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .recommendations-list li::before {
    content: "•";
    position: absolute;
    left: 4px;
    color: var(--color-agri);
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }
</style>
